🔥 1. AWS Lambda – What is Serverless?

Lambda = Serverless Compute Service
Means:

No server management

Pay only when your function runs

Automatic scaling

Event-driven execution

Highly available

Example:
S3 upload → Trigger Lambda → Process image → Save to S3.

Benefits:

Zero administration

Auto scaling

High availability

Pay-per-use

Integrates with 200+ AWS services

