🔥 5. Lambda Hot Start vs Cold Start
Cold Start

Happens when Lambda container is created first time

Time delay 200ms–2s

Hot Start

Container warm

Execution very fast (few ms)

Reduce Cold Starts:

Enable Provisioned Concurrency

Use lighter runtimes (Node/Python)

Avoid huge libraries

