🔥 8. Lambda – Synchronous vs Asynchronous Execution
Synchronous (Real-time response)

Examples:

API Gateway

ALB

Function URLs

CLI invoke

Client waits for result.

Asynchronous (Event-based)

Examples:

S3 events

SNS

EventBridge

SES

Lambda queues event → retries 3 times → error → goes to DLQ.

🔥 9. Dead Letter Queue (DLQ) in Lambda

If Lambda fails → send the failed event to:

SQS Queue, OR

SNS Topic

Used for debugging failed executions.

