🔥 21. Connect Lambda to RDS Database (MySQL/Postgres)

Steps:

Put Lambda in same VPC as RDS

Add security group rules

Install MySQL/Postgres library

Use connection pool

Query database

Python Example:

import pymysql

conn = pymysql.connect(
    host="db.endpoint",
    user="admin",
    password="password",
    db="mydb"
)

def lambda_handler(event, context):
    with conn.cursor() as cur:
        cur.execute("SELECT * FROM users")
        data = cur.fetchall()
    return data

🔥 22. Reserved vs Provisioned Concurrency
Reserved Concurrency

Limits max executions

Prevents throttling

Guarantees capacity for your function

Provisioned Concurrency

Pre-warms Lambda

Zero cold starts

Used for production APIs

